{
  "description": "std-tree — generic hierarchical node browser. Fetches a flat TreeNode collection and renders it through file-tree's flat `items` mode (parentId-nested at render time by the component, not the .lolo); OPEN_NODE is the external handoff for a selected node's id. Rebindable: pass `fields` at the call site to retarget it at any parent-pointer entity (categories, org units, comment threads).",
